+interval from that node's required history start through the evidence collection
+time, inclusively; later editorial time does not change this test. A mismatch,
+short claim or future collection falls back to ordinary evaluation. A matching
+claim may establish `not_affected` before unavailable typed kernel history is
+required, with an operator-attributed reason and no invented kernel identity or
